  <title>City Council Regular Meeting</title>
  <link>https://bellevuewa.gov/events/city-council-regular-meeting-37</link>
  <description>&lt;span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden"&gt;City Council Regular Meeting&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="field field--name-uid field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;span lang about="https://bellevuewa.gov/users/kmmiller" typeof="schema:Person" property="schema:name" datatype&gt;KMMiller&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="field field--name-created field--type-created field--label-hidden"&gt;&lt;time datetime="2025-12-11T11:57:26-08:00" title="Thursday, December 11, 2025 - 11:57" class="datetime"&gt;Thu, 12/11/2025 - 11:57&lt;/time&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;
  &lt;div class="layout layout--onecol"&gt;
    &lt;div class="layout__region layout__region--content"&gt;
      

            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-event-dates field--type-daterange field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;time datetime="2026-10-20T12:00:00Z" class="datetime"&gt;October 20 2026&lt;/time&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
      

            &lt;div class="field field--name-field-event-time field--type-time-range field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;6:00 PM - 10:00 PM&lt;/div&gt;
      

  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-all-day-event field--type-boolean field--label-inline"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;All Day Event&lt;/div&gt;
                  &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Off&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-event-registration field--type-boolean field--label-inline"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Event Registration&lt;/div&gt;
                  &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Free&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-email field--type-email field--label-inline"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Email&lt;/div&gt;
                  &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;a href="mailto:CouncilOffice@bellevuewa.gov"&gt;CouncilOffice@bellevuewa.gov&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-telephone field--type-telephone field--label-inline"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Telephone&lt;/div&gt;
                  &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;a href="tel:425-452-7810"&gt;425-452-7810&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-address field--type-address field--label-inline"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Location&lt;/div&gt;
                  &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;p class="address" translate="no"&gt;
          Bellevue City Hall, 450 110th Ave NE, Council Chambers (Room 1E-126)          &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-inline"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Description&lt;/div&gt;
                  &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;City Council meetings are held the first four Tuesdays of each month. The meetings are hybrid, with in-person and virtual options.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Connection details can be found on the associated meeting agenda at this link:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://bellevue.legistar.com/Calendar.aspx"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Council Agendas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;The meeting may also be viewed live on Bellevue TV channel 21 or livestreamed on&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/bellevuetelevision" target="_blank" title="(opens in a new window)"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Bellevue TV YouTube&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oral Communications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;To speak at the meeting, you may attend in-person, via phone, or Zoom. To be added to the speaker list for oral communications, please fill out the webform to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://bellevuewa.gov/council-oral-comms"&gt;&lt;span&gt;sign up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;. The form will be open at 12 p.m. the day of the meeting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-hide-from-city-calendar field--type-boolean field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Hide from City Calendar&lt;/div&gt;
                  &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Off&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;


  &lt;div class="field field--name-field-canceled field--type-boolean field--label-above"&gt;
    &lt;div class="field__label"&gt;Canceled&lt;/div&gt;
                  &lt;div class="field__item"&gt;Off&lt;/div&gt;
              &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
</description>
